  "solution": "**Given : **\n\nSP = Rs.132000\n\nProfit = 10%\n\n**Calculation : **\n\nProfit = 10% = 1/10\n\nSP = 11 unit = 132000\n\n⇒ 1 unit = 12000\n\nCP = 10 × 12000 = 120000\n\nNow, SP = Rs.126000\n\nProfit = 126000 - 120000 = 6000\n\nProfit% = 6000/120000 × 100 = 60/12 = 5%\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 5%.**",
